## Rubber
component-rubber = Rubber
component-rubber-made-of-part = vulcanised caoutchouc
component-rubber-description-novice = An elastic material: it stretches and squeezes, then comes back to its shape. Dropper caps, balloons and hoses are made of it.
component-rubber-description-school = Rubber is made of caoutchouc heated with sulphur (vulcanisation). Ordinary soft rubber is a little denser than water — 1.1 g/cm³ — and sinks; pure caoutchouc is lighter than water.
